      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A group of men appeared on the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Shizilin Bridge",
            "zh": "狮子林桥"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Tianjin, drawing cheers from a large crowd. “Splash!”“Splash!” “Splash!” One by one, they dived off the bridge into the water below, while "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "spectators"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " watched and applauded."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The divers are part of an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "amateur",
            "ref": "v-amateur"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " diving team in the city. Most team members are aged over 60, with some having started diving in their youth while others only picked up the hobby after "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "retirement",
            "ref": "v-retirement"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “It’s all just for fun and exercise,” explained one diver when asked about their motivation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Recently, to their surprise, more and more young visitors have been coming to watch them, with some even expressing interest in trying it themselves. This development has "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "concerned",
            "ref": "v-concern"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the elderly divers. The bridge stands about six metres above the water, and the river below is six to seven metres deep—it’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "risky",
            "ref": "v-risky"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for inexperienced divers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“We’ve been doing this for years and know the water conditions well,” one "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "senior",
            "ref": "v-senior"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " diver noted. “But for beginners, it could be dangerous.” The team now finds themselves not only enjoying their hobby but also having to advise inexperienced not to try. They suggest that interested young people should first receive proper training."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Every morning, the retired divers continue their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "routine",
            "ref": "v-routine"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", carefully "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stretching",
            "ref": "v-stretch"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their arms and legs before taking turns diving into the river. Their graceful movements through the air and smooth entry into the water continue to draw "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "applause",
            "ref": "v-applause"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from the banks, though they always remember to remind newcomers: “Safety first, enjoyment second.”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
